---
title: Host account verification
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> applied
    applied --> under_review: host submits documents
    under_review --> approved: all required documents approved
    under_review --> changes_requested: admin
    under_review --> rejected: admin with reason
    changes_requested --> under_review: host resubmits
    rejected --> applied: after 30 days
    approved --> under_review: legal field changed
    approved --> suspended: admin with reason
    suspended --> approved: admin unsuspends
    approved --> banned: admin
    suspended --> banned: admin
    banned --> [*]
